    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Thanks Luna.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: e11b356d-ad74-46ce-9a94-146619b18147
    Position: {x: 714, y: 206}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: I run a flower shop for cat's sake! Who will buy my flowers
        now that they are all black and white!?
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 1ffda9d4-b3c5-42a8-a417-35c05a40c2eb
    Position: {x: 1487, y: 206}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: Does your fur color define you?
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 9065b488-e6ad-4e97-b892-7b4b159bf037
    Position: {x: 446, y: 630}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: 'I still bought your flowers, did I not? '
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 996f52a6-4c7c-4b58-bc58-430fe7772b10
    Position: {x: 685, y: 630}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: If not for their color, then why? I will tell you.
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: 3ce8cf6a-b9da-4229-b539-e6b0e020f4a8
    Position: {x: 213, y: 630}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
    Event: 
    SecoundCharacter: {fileID: 0}
    SecoundPortraitPosition: 0
    SecoundEmotion: 
    AudioClips:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: {fileID: 0}
    TextType:
    - languageEnum: 0
      LanguageGenericType: No. And neither does it for the flowers, darling. To me
        the flowers look all the same. But even so-
    - languageEnum: 1
      LanguageGenericType: 
    Duration: 10
  - NodeGuid: b952acbf-c301-4c7d-a86e-6833f43ef895
    Position: {x: 202, y: 206}
    Character: {fileID: 0}
    PortraitPosition: 0
    Emotion: 
